    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Prerequisite: Level 2+ Warlock, a Warlock Cantrip That Deals Damage via an Attack Roll</p></blockquote><p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that requires an attack roll. When you hit a Large or smaller creature with that cantrip, you can push the creature up to 10 feet straight away from you.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can gain this invocation more than once. Each time you do so, choose a different eligible cantrip.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-5xV7SaKI7sGaeKvq\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Make Repelling</strong> activity can be used to enchant a cantrip which adds \", Repelling\" as a reminder.</p></section>",
